# Keep the build context small and free of things that must never be baked into an image.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs only package.json, tsconfig.json and src/, so nothing here would have
# reached the image anyway — but the whole context is still transferred to the daemon on every
# build, and `data/` plus `node_modules/` make that needlessly slow.

node_modules
dist
.git
.gitignore

# ⚠️ The irreplaceable artefact. It is bind-mounted at runtime, never copied in.
data

# Mounted at runtime (compose.yaml), never built in. The repository is public.
secrets

aidlc-docs
test
*.md
!README.md
